 "description": "A profession's or a brand team's short-form week: ideas, how its breakouts are made, what to check before posting. For doctors (\ud53c\ubd80\uacfc, \uc131\ud615\uc678\uacfc \u2026), dentists, Korean medicine, pharmacists, lawyers, tax accountants, labor attorneys, accountants, realtors and brand teams: this week's ideas (a title, the way, the first line, how to shoot it); the ways the field's breakout videos are made, with their links and views; what its breakouts share; one creator's breakout beside their own usual video; memes, and this week's formats with the field's twist (`format_id` for shorti_format); what to check before posting, each line with the Korean statute behind it; for brand teams a week's posting plan. Also for creators by field (\ubdf0\ud2f0, \ud328\uc158, \ub9ac\ube59, \ud478\ub4dc, \ubc08\u00b7\ucf54\ubbf8\ub514, \uc77c\uc0c1, \ubc18\ub824\ub3d9\ubb3c, \uc6b4\ub3d9, \uc5ec\ud589, \ub304\uc2a4), \uccb4\ud5d8\ub2e8 reviewers (\ubdf0\ud2f0 \u00b7 \ub9db\uc9d1 \u00b7 \uc0dd\ud65c\uc6a9\ud488 \uccb4\ud5d8\ub2e8), shop owners (\uc2dd\ub2f9\u00b7\uce74\ud398, \ubbf8\uc6a9\uc2e4\u00b7\ub124\uc77c, \uc6b4\ub3d9 \uc13c\ud130) and actors: the persona's breakouts with their links and views, the formats many in it shoot and, in Korean, the formats rising in the West near it with no Korean video yet. `field` in the person's own words; one Shorti does not read answers the fields and personas it does. lang='en' reads the English-speaking market's videos.",
